  have hn:primeProductNorm p D≤ Z^(firstDyadicExponent Z (primeProductNorm p C)+2*ell+3*eta):=by
    calc
      _≤ primeProductNorm p (C∪cubePrincipalSupport b.support b.leftExponent b.rightExponent b.leftBit b.rightBit):=
